            "description": "<p data-block-key=\"4stdq\">Order of the health officer of the city and county of San Francisco encouraging COVID-19 vaccine coverage and reducing disease risks.</p><p data-block-key=\"ps0y5\">Additional resources regarding C19-07y:</p><ul><li data-block-key=\"pfcpp\"><a href=\"https://sf.gov/information/summary-changes-c19-07y\">Summary of changes to Health Order C19-07y</a></li><li data-block-key=\"hyoe6\">See below under “Resources” for frequently asked questions about C19-07y</li><li data-block-key=\"ioo4e\"><a href=\"https://sf.gov/sites/default/files/2022-05/C19-07-Redline.pdf\">Redline of Health Order C19-07y</a>, comparing December 21, 2022 version to September 15, 2022 version</li><li data-block-key=\"jrxbh\"><a href=\"https://sf.gov/information/digital-vaccine-cards\">Vaccine verification</a></li><li data-block-key=\"x378w\">Sample vaccine verification or declination form: <a href=\"https://sf.gov/file/sample-vaccination-declination-or-ascertainment-form-english\">English</a>  | <a href=\"https://sf.gov/file/sample-vaccination-declination-or-ascertainment-form-chinese\">中文</a>  | <a href=\"https://sf.gov/file/sample-vaccination-declination-or-ascertainment-form-pilipino\">Filipino</a>  | <a href=\"https://sf.gov/file/sample-vaccination-declination-or-ascertainment-form-spanish\">Español</a></li></ul>",
            "file": "https://media.api.sf.gov/documents/C19-07-Safer-Return-Together-Health-Order_0_hb9qGHI.pdf",
            "published_date": "2022-12-22",
            "tags": []
        },
